### Check first
Open [this component](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/highlights) and its [metrics](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/metrics). Correlate the reported XID code with driver logs, affected GPUs and workload failures. The configured threshold is **{{threshold}}** in the monitor chart's unit.

### Likely causes
Driver faults, GPU hardware errors or workload-specific device faults.

### Fix
Use the XID code to select the documented driver/hardware remedy; preserve logs before any node maintenance.

### Verify
The XID metric reports zero after the documented recovery, this check clears and the affected workload succeeds. A continuing nonzero gauge keeps this check failing. If samples are absent, investigate the exporter and Collector: this threshold check cannot establish healthy operation without data.
